  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Buoy Observation Data Provided by Korea Ocean Research and Development Institute (KORDI) in NEAR-GOOS Regional Real Time Data Base (RRTDB)",
  "description": "Buoy observation data provided by Korea Ocean Research and Development Institute (the Republic of Korea ). Data are available from 3 July 1999 in the directory pub/KORDI. Contents of the data are described in the www site of KORDI (http://near-goos.kordi.re.kr). Within the data, JMA decodes sea temperature and wind data. The decoded sea temperature data are available in the directory pub/subst, and the wind data are in the directory pub/wind, respectively. Data stations include: Sokcho, Wangdol, Kwangan, Kyobon, Chulwoon, Seocheon, Taean, Incheon, Boksacho, Donongtan, Ieodo, and Banseo. Observed data include: water temperature, wave height, wave potential, wind speed, wind d. air temperature, humidity, and air pressure. Data sets may be obtained directly from the North-East Asian Regional - Global Ocean Observing System (NEAR-GOOS) Regional Real Time Data Base (RRTDB) at http://goos.kishou.go.jp/ with a user account. First time users must register to gain database access.\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To offer basic data service to NEAR-GOOS and GOOS communities as part of the NEAR-GOOS project.",
  "url": "https://zenodo.org/records/23569502",
